      "F contains an asymmetric attribution (isolating B from the redundant A/B pair).",
      "F makes an unprovable negative claim about host protein targets from a single host gene knockout.",
      "H is the intended key designed to catch students settling for flawed distractors."
    ],
    "avoid_repeating": [
      "Do not harp purely on 'CFUs don't equal biochemistry'—the majority has built an immunity to that by calling it pedantry. Instead, focus entirely on *exam construction, structural inconsistencies within F, and Colleague 2's own original insight*."
    ]
  },
