    "final_round_objective": "Round 8 is the final round. My goal is to make the definitive closing case for Option H, aiming to induce last-second epistemic doubt in Colleague 2 (who started at H) or Colleague 1/3 to force a split or deadlock, or at the very least cement a robust 2-vote minority that challenges consensus.",
