      "Deliver a powerful, statesperson-like closing argument on scientific integrity vs. accommodating item flaws.",
      "Address the 'imperfect shorthand' concession: Highlight that the F-camp's entire defense requires assuming the exam author was sloppy (omitting Factor A in Clause 1, assuming host protein targeting for Factor C without testing delta-A delta-C, relying on empty-set logic).",
